                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">The sports I play, teams I've joined, jersey numbers, and memorable game highlights.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div onclick="navigateTo('age')" class="cursor-pointer flex items-start gap-4 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary-500/40 transition">
                        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0">
                            <i data-lucide="calendar-heart" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Age & Life Milestones &rarr;</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Live age tracker, birthday details, zodiac sign, and major personal milestones over the years.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div onclick="navigateTo('hobbies')" class="cursor-pointer flex items-start gap-4 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary-500/40 transition">
                        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-500/10 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400 shrink-0">
                            <i data-lucide="gamepad-2" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Hobbies & Interests &rarr;</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">What I love doing in my free time—music playlists, gaming, coding projects, and travel.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- =================================================================
             PAGE 2: SCHOOL HISTORY
             ================================================================= -->
        <section id="page-school" class="page-section hidden space-y-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6">
