                    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">School History</h1>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2 max-w-2xl">Every school I attended, what I learned, and the achievements along the way.</p>
                </div>
                <button onclick="navigateTo('about')" class="self-start sm:self-auto px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
