                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">[Your High School Name]</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400 mt-0.5">High School Diploma • STEM Strand</p>
